1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,629
You're watching a suitcase go round.

2
00:00:05,749 --> 00:00:09,547
At a Houston airport, passengers watched this every day.

3
00:00:09,667 --> 00:00:10,965
And they complained.

4
00:00:11,085 --> 00:00:13,362
The wait at baggage claim was too long.

5
00:00:13,982 --> 00:00:16,322
So the airport did the obvious thing.

6
00:00:16,442 --> 00:00:18,527
It hired more baggage handlers.

7
00:00:18,647 --> 00:00:20,432
The wait fell to eight minutes,

8
00:00:20,552 --> 00:00:22,764
well within industry benchmarks.

9
00:00:23,084 --> 00:00:24,803
The complaints didn't stop.

10
00:00:25,423 --> 00:00:26,879
So they looked closer.

11
00:00:26,999 --> 00:00:29,096
One minute walking from the gate.

12
00:00:29,216 --> 00:00:31,254
Seven minutes standing at the belt.

13
00:00:31,374 --> 00:00:34,241
Almost ninety percent of the trip, doing nothing.

14
00:00:34,861 --> 00:00:36,644
So they made the walk longer.

15
00:00:36,764 --> 00:00:40,133
They moved the arrival gates away from the main terminal,

16
00:00:40,253 --> 00:00:42,914
and sent the bags to the outermost carousel.

17
00:00:43,034 --> 00:00:45,540
Passengers now walked six times longer.

18
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:47,831
Complaints dropped to near zero.

19
00:00:48,351 --> 00:00:50,133
Nobody sped up the bags.

20
00:00:50,253 --> 00:00:51,994
People don't hate waiting.

21
00:00:52,114 --> 00:00:53,766
They hate standing still.

22
00:00:54,486 --> 00:00:56,509
This TikTok did the same thing.

23
00:00:56,629 --> 00:00:59,108
It opened on a suitcase going round.

24
00:00:59,227 --> 00:01:00,345
No words.

25
00:01:00,465 --> 00:01:02,125
Then it never stood still.

26
00:01:02,445 --> 00:01:03,483
You stayed.

27
00:01:04,203 --> 00:01:05,598
So here's your bag.

28
00:01:06,218 --> 00:01:09,933
Which one gets you: the faster bags, or the longer walk?
